! R7: pp -> H2 H2 -> b b~ b b~, m_H2 = 150 GeV, ctau = 0.481 mm.
!
! Production kinematics come from a genuine MadGraph pp -> h2 h2 pair-
! production LHE sample (LLscalar_v3_UFO pack, PDG 9000006, m_h2 = 150 GeV;
! see docs/R7_H2_PAIR_4B_RESULT.md), generated once and reused unchanged for
! all three R7 lifetime cards.
!
! The LHE's stable final-state PDG has been relabelled 9000006 -> 35 (a pure
! text substitution of the LHE PDG code; mass, momenta and event kinematics
! are byte-identical). This is required because Pythia8's ResonanceDecays
! machinery -- needed to shower the b b~ decay products into real jets, as
! opposed to the simple/non-showered "particle decay" treatment used for low
! -mass hadron decays -- requires a registered ResonanceWidths object for the
! decaying PDG. Pythia only auto-registers this for its own built-in
! resonance slots (e.g. PDG 35, "H0"); a fully custom PDG (9000006) has none,
! and registering one requires bespoke C++ code, which is out of scope for a
! cmnd-only patch and would go beyond the R4 patch boundary. R4 already
! established and validated PDG 35 as the stand-in slot for a bb~-decaying
! 2HDM-like heavy scalar LLP (see cards/r4_smoke/scalar_regression.cmnd in
! the r4 work); this card reuses that same validated mechanism, now fed by
! genuine H2-H2 pair-production kinematics instead of single-resonance
! internal production.
!
! Recast:llpPdgIds and the 35:... particle-data lines are placed before the
! Main:subrun block deliberately: settings placed after a "Main:subrun = N"
! marker are subrun-scoped and only take effect when Pythia processes that
! subrun (i.e. at pythia.init() for subrun 0), but the recast binary reads
! Recast:llpPdgIds immediately after pythia.readFile(), before init() runs.
Main:numberOfEvents = 1000
Main:timesAllowErrors = 3
Init:showChangedSettings = on
Init:showChangedParticleData = off
Next:numberCount = 5000
Next:numberShowInfo = 0
Next:numberShowProcess = 0
Next:numberShowEvent = 0

PartonLevel:MPI = off
PartonLevel:ISR = on
PartonLevel:FSR = on
HadronLevel:Hadronize = on
Tune:pp = 21

Higgs:useBSM = on
35:m0 = 150.
35:mMin = 100.
35:tau0 = 0.481
35:onMode = off
35:onIfMatch = 5 -5

Recast:llpPdgIds = {35}

Beams:frameType = 4
LHEFInputs:nSubruns = 1
Main:subrun = 0
Beams:LHEF = @@LHE_PATH@@
